<statement>
<p>
	Otherwise, the point is not valid.
</p>

<tabular valign="top" top="minor">
	<col width="12%"/>
	<col width="88%"/>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Inputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>x</pf> (double) double — is the x -value of a point on the Wordle game board</p>
			<p><pf>y</pf> (double) double — is the y -value of a point on the Wordle game board</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Outputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>is_valid</pf> (boolean) number — is true (or 1) if the point is valid and is false (or 0) if the point is not valid</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell>Details:</cell>
		<cell><p>While you are developing this code, it may be helpful to think about a game board.</p></cell>
	</row>
</tabular>

</statement>
